<view class="page">
  <view class="hero"><view><view class="eyebrow">旅行计划</view><view class="title">我的行程</view><view class="subtitle">按天安排，预算和体验都不落下</view></view><button class="add" bindtap="createTrip"><ui-icon name="plus" size="{{27}}" tone="white" /><text>新建</text></button></view>
  <view class="filters"><view class="search-box"><ui-icon name="search" size="{{28}}" tone="muted" /><input class="search" placeholder="搜索行程、城市或备注" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="search"/></view><scroll-view class="status-scroll" scroll-x><view class="status-row"><view class="status-filter {{activeStatus === item.key ? 'active' : ''}}" wx:for="{{statuses}}" wx:key="key" data-status="{{item.key}}" bindtap="filterStatus">{{item.label}}</view></view></scroll-view></view>
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!allTripCount}}"><view class="empty-mark"><ui-icon name="route" size="{{42}}" tone="blue" /></view><view class="empty-title">从一次旅行开始</view><view class="empty-copy">确定日期和城市，再把想去的酒店、餐厅加入每天的安排。</view><view class="empty-steps"><view><text><ui-icon name="calendar" size="{{24}}" tone="blue" /></text>创建行程</view><view><text><ui-icon name="route" size="{{24}}" tone="green" /></text>安排日程</view><view><text><ui-icon name="wallet" size="{{24}}" tone="accent" /></text>管理预算</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="createTrip"><ui-icon name="plus" size="{{28}}" tone="white" /><text>创建第一段行程</text></button></view>
  <view class="empty" wx:elif="{{!trips.length}}"><view class="empty-title">没有符合条件的行程</view><view class="empty-copy">换个关键词或状态试试，已有行程不会受到影响。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="clearFilters">清除筛选</button></view>
  <view class="group" wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="key"><view class="group-title"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text>{{item.items.length}} 个</text></view><view class="trip-card" wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:for-item="trip" wx:key="id" data-id="{{trip.id}}" bindtap="openTrip"><view class="trip-top"><view class="status {{trip.status}}">{{trip.statusLabel}}</view><view class="count">{{trip.progressText}}</view></view><view class="trip-title">{{trip.title}}</view><view class="trip-meta"><ui-icon name="calendar" size="{{24}}" tone="muted" /><text>{{trip.cityText}} · {{trip.dateText}}</text></view><view class="trip-foot"><view><ui-icon name="route" size="{{25}}" tone="muted" /><text>{{trip.planCount}} 项日程</text></view><view><ui-icon name="wallet" size="{{25}}" tone="muted" /><text>{{trip.budgetText}}</text></view><ui-icon name="chevron-right" size="{{27}}" tone="muted" /></view></view></view>
</view>
